T1  - Premature mortality due to noncommunicable diseases in Brazilian capitals: redistribution of garbage causes and evolution by social deprivation strata.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1590/1980-549720230002.supl.1
A1  - Malta, Deborah Carvalho
A1  - Teixeira, Renato Azeredo
A1  - Cardoso, Lais Santos de Magalhaes
A1  - Souza, Juliana Bottoni de
A1  - Bernal, Regina Tomie Ivata
A1  - Pinheiro, Pedro Cisalpino
