T1  - Verbal autopsy instruments for 'causes and circumstances' surrounding drowning deaths in low- and middle-income countries: a scoping review.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1136/ip-2025-045685
A1  - Ray-Bennett, Nibedita S
A1  - Dissanayake, Lasith
A1  - Ekezie, Winifred
A1  - MacLeod, Lauren
