T1  - Neutrophil-Related Gene Signatures for Ischemic Stroke Diagnosis.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.2174/0109298673405347250925073240
A1  - Qin, Rongxing
A1  - Liang, Xiaojun
A1  - Xu, Wei
