T1  - Outcomes of Amulet occluder implantation following Watchman screen failure in the ADVANCE LAA study: a real-world analysis of procedural success and safety.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1093/europace/euag228
A1  - Lakkireddy, Dhanunjaya
A1  - Saw, Jacqueline
