T1  - Prognostic Value of Conventional and Modified Naples Scores for In-Hospital Mortality in Patients with Non-ST-Elevation Acute Coronary Syndrome.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.3390/medicina62081573
A1  - Cekici, Yusuf
A1  - Yildirim, Abdullah
A1  - Pacaci, Emre
