T1  - Prognostic value of the triglyceride-glucose index combined with glycemic variability for all-cause mortality in patients with sepsis: A retrospective cohort study.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1177/00368504261465749
A1  - Wang, Ao
A1  - Fu, Yuechen
A1  - Li, Ran
