T1  - Regional disparities in breast cancer mortality in Brazil: a spatial analysis using uncorrected and adjusted data, 2000-2023.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1038/s41598-026-37844-w
A1  - de Araujo Santos Camargo, Juliana Dantas
A1  - Camargo, Savio Ferreira
