T1  - Lipomatous hypertrophy of cardiac interatrial septum: A case report.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1097/MD.0000000000044991
A1  - Laima, Sigitas
A1  - Pauliukonyte, Migle
A1  - Chmieliauskas, Sigitas
A1  - Berukstis, Andrius
A1  - Vasiljevaite, Diana
