T1  - Postmortem computed tomography-based evaluation of brain decomposition: Correlation with postmortem interval and cause-of-death determinability.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.legalmed.2025.102710
A1  - Fukuda, Haruki
A1  - Tokue, Hiroyuki
A1  - Shiraishi, Miyuki
