T1  - A CLINICAL PREDICTION MODEL FOR SHORT-TERM PROGNOSIS IN PATIENTS WITH NON-ACUTE MYOCARDIAL INFARCTION-RELATED CARDIOGENIC SHOCK.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1097/SHK.0000000000002535
A1  - Wang, Xiaoke
