T1  - Predictive power of ALBI score-based nomogram for 30-day mortality following transcatheter aortic valve implantation.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/17520363.2025.2483157
A1  - Yildirim, Abdullah
A1  - Genc, Omer
A1  - Evlice, Mert
A1  - Erdogan, Aslan
