T1  - Artificial intelligence-based fully automated stress left ventricular ejection fraction as a prognostic marker in patients undergoing stress cardiovascular magnetic resonance.
T3  - 39023216[Comment in: Eur Heart J Cardiovasc Imaging. 2024 Sep 30;25(10):1349-1350. doi: 10.1093/ehjci/jeae185.]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1093/ehjci/jeae168
