T1  - Intestinal mRNA expression profiles associated with mucosal healing in ustekinumab-treated Crohn's disease patients: bioinformatics analysis and prospective cohort validation.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1186/s12967-024-05427-w
A1  - Li, Qing
A1  - Huang, Zicheng
A1  - Yang, Hongsheng
A1  - Tang, Jian
