T1  - Hypothetical acceptability of minimally invasive tissue sampling and considerations for practice: A qualitative study in Vietnam.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/17441692.2024.2403097
A1  - Phuong, Nhung Doan
A1  - Dieu, Ngan Ta Thi
A1  - Nguyen, My Le Thao
A1  - Phuoc, An Luu
A1  - Suwalowska, Halina
A1  - Nguyen, Duy Manh
A1  - Nguyen, Ha Thi Lien
A1  - Vu, Huong Thi Thu
