T1  - Comparison of 2 Methods for Estimating Multiple Sclerosis-Related Mortality.
T3  - 38830175[Erratum in: Neurology. 2024 Jul 9;103(1):e209596. doi: 10.1212/WNL.0000000000209596.]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1212/WNL.0000000000207925
