T1  - Measuring misclassification of Covid-19 as garbage codes: Results of investigating 1,365 deaths and implications for vital statistics in Brazil.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1371/journal.pgph.0000199
A1  - Franca, Elisabeth B
A1  - Ishitani, Lenice H
A1  - de Abreu, Daisy Maria Xavier
A1  - Teixeira, Renato Azeredo
A1  - Correa, Paulo Roberto Lopes
