T1  - Monthly excess mortality across counties in the United States during the Covid-19 pandemic, March 2020 to February 2022.
T3  - 37352359[Update in: Sci Adv. 2023 Jun 23;9(25):eadf9742. doi: 10.1126/sciadv.adf9742.]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1101/2022.04.23.22274192
A1  - Paglino, Eugenio
A1  - Lundberg, Dielle J
