T1  - Body Mass Index and Cause-Specific Mortality after Lung Transplantation in the United States.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1513/AnnalsATS.202207-613OC
A1  - Anderson, Michaela R
A1  - Cantu, Ed
A1  - Shashaty, Michael
A1  - Benvenuto, Luke
