T1  - Prognostic Value of Machine-Learning-Based PRAISE Score for Ischemic and Bleeding Events in Patients With Acute Coronary Syndrome Undergoing Percutaneous Coronary Intervention.
T3  - 37066805[Erratum in: J Am Heart Assoc. 2023 Apr 18;12(8):e027677. doi: 10.1161/JAHA.122.027677.]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1161/JAHA.122.025812
A1  - Shi, Boqun
A1  - Wang, Hao-Yu
A1  - Liu, Jinpeng
A1  - Cai, Zhongxing
A1  - Song, Chenxi
A1  - Yin, Dong
