T1  - Reevaluation of ambiguous genetic variants in sudden unexplained deaths of a young cohort.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1007/s00414-023-02951-0
A1  - Martinez-Barrios, Estefania
A1  - Sarquella-Brugada, Georgia
