T3  - 36126127[Comment in: Circ Cardiovasc Imaging. 2022 Sep;15(9):e014744. doi: 10.1161/CIRCIMAGING.122.014744.], 36256729[Erratum in: Circ Cardiovasc Imaging. 2022 Oct;15(10):e000078. doi: 10.1161/HCI.0000000000000078.]
