T1  - Sex-specific evaluation and redevelopment of the GRACE score in non-ST-segment elevation acute coronary syndromes in populations from the UK and Switzerland: a multinational analysis with external cohort validation.
T3  - 36049492[Comment in: Lancet. 2022 Sep 3;400(10354):710-711. doi: 10.1016/S0140-6736(22)01607-5.], 36610765[Comment in: Lancet. 2023 Jan 7;401(10370):22-23. doi: 10.1016/S0140-6736(22)02473-4.]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/S0140-6736(22)01483-0
A1  - Wenzl, Florian A
A1  - Kraler, Simon
A1  - Ambler, Gareth
A1  - Weston, Clive
A1  - Herzog, Sereina A
A1  - Raber, Lorenz
