T1  - Red Cell Distribution Width in Acute Pulmonary Embolism Patients Improves 30-Day Mortality Risk Stratification Based on the Pulmonary Embolism Severity Index.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.hlc.2021.12.006
A1  - Jurin, Ivana
A1  - Trkulja, Vladimir
A1  - Lucijanic, Marko
A1  - Pejic, Josip
