T1  - Redistribution of garbage codes to underlying causes of death: a systematic analysis on Italy and a comparison with most populous Western European countries based on the Global Burden of Disease Study 2019.
T3  - 35289364[Erratum in: Eur J Public Health. 2022 Apr 1;32(2):331. doi: 10.1093/eurpub/ckac021.]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1093/eurpub/ckab194
A1  - Monasta, Lorenzo
