T1  - Benefit of Sarcopenia Screening in Older Patients Undergoing Surgical Aortic Valve Replacement.
T3  - 34389305[Comment in: Ann Thorac Surg. 2022 Jun;113(6):2026. doi: 10.1016/j.athoracsur.2021.07.023.]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.athoracsur.2021.06.067
A1  - Lee, Seung-Ah
A1  - Jang, Il-Young
A1  - Park, Seo-Young
