T1  - Validation of physician certified verbal autopsy using conventional autopsy: a large study of adult non-external causes of death in a metropolitan area in Brazil.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1186/s12889-022-13081-4
A1  - de Andre, Carmen Diva Saldiva
