T1  - Two New Neutrophil Subsets Define a Discriminating Sepsis Signature.
T3  - 34788202[Comment in: Am J Respir Crit Care Med. 2022 Jan 1;205(1):2-4. doi: 10.1164/rccm.202110-2291ED.]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1164/rccm.202104-1027OC
A1  - Meghraoui-Kheddar, Aida
A1  - Chousterman, Benjamin G
A1  - Guillou, Noelline
A1  - Barone, Sierra M
A1  - Granjeaud, Samuel
