T1  - Assessing the Diagnostic Accuracy of Physicians for Home Death Certification in Shanghai: Application of SmartVA.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.3389/fpubh.2022.842880
A1  - Chen, Lei
A1  - Xia, Tian
A1  - Rampatige, Rasika
A1  - Li, Hang
A1  - Adair, Tim
