T1  - Improved Risk Stratification for Ventricular Arrhythmias and Sudden Death in Patients With Nonischemic Dilated Cardiomyopathy.
T3  - 34112318[Comment in: J Am Coll Cardiol. 2021 Jun 15;77(23):2906-2908. doi: 10.1016/j.jacc.2021.04.031.]
