T1  - Dynamic alpha-Fetoprotein Response and Outcomes After Liver Transplant for Hepatocellular Carcinoma.
T3  - 33950253[Comment in: JAMA Surg. 2021 Jun 1;156(6):567-568. doi: 10.1001/jamasurg.2021.0955.], 35019961[Comment in: JAMA Surg. 2022 Apr 1;157(4):359-360. doi: 10.1001/jamasurg.2021.4570.], 35058057[Comment in: Surgery. 2022 Jun;171(6):1695-1696. doi: 10.1016/j.surg.2021.12.014.]
