T1  - Use of Machine Learning Models to Predict Death After Acute Myocardial Infarction.
T3  - 33688913[Comment in: JAMA Cardiol. 2021 Jun 1;6(6):621-623. doi: 10.1001/jamacardio.2021.0139.], 34586335[Comment in: JAMA Cardiol. 2021 Dec 1;6(12):1465. doi: 10.1001/jamacardio.2021.3712.]
