T1  - Clinical diagnoses vs. autopsy findings in early deceased septic patients in the intensive care: a retrospective cohort study.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1007/s00428-020-02984-5
A1  - Driessen, Rob G H
A1  - Latten, Bartholomeus G H
A1  - Bergmans, Dennis C J J
