T1  - Performance of Emergency Heart Failure Mortality Risk Grade in the Emergency Department.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.5811/westjem.2021.1.48978
A1  - Garg, Nidhi
A1  - Pekmezaris, Renee
A1  - Stevens, Gerin
