T1  - Comparison of the Immunotherapy Response Evaluation Criteria in Solid Tumours (iRECIST) with RECIST for capturing treatment response of patients with metastatic urothelial carcinoma treated with pembrolizumab.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1111/bju.15176
A1  - Fukuokaya, Wataru
A1  - Kimura, Takahiro
A1  - Yanagisawa, Takafumi
A1  - Kimura, Shoji
A1  - Tsuzuki, Shunsuke
A1  - Koike, Yuhei
