T1  - Impact of hyperuricemia on mortality related to aortic diseases: a 3.8-year nationwide community-based cohort study.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1038/s41598-020-71301-6
A1  - Otaki, Yoichiro
A1  - Watanabe, Tetsu
A1  - Konta, Tsuneo
