T1  - Accuracy of identifying incident stroke cases from linked health care data in UK Biobank.
T3  - 32616676[Comment in: Neurology. 2020 Aug 11;95(6):250. doi: 10.1212/WNL.0000000000009931.]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1212/WNL.0000000000009924
