T1  - Incorporation of renal function in mortality risk assessment for pulmonary arterial hypertension.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.healun.2020.03.026
A1  - Zelt, Jason G E
A1  - Hossain, Alomgir
A1  - Sun, Louise Y
A1  - Mehta, Sanjay
A1  - Chandy, George
A1  - Davies, Ross A
