T1  - Out-of-Hospital 30-day Deaths After Cardiac Surgery Are Often Underreported.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.athoracsur.2019.09.061
A1  - Hannan, Edward L
A1  - Samadashvili, Zaza
A1  - Cozzens, Kimberly
