T1  - Antimicrobial anaphylaxis: the changing face of severe antimicrobial allergy.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1093/jac/dkz422
A1  - Hall, Victoria
A1  - Wong, Micah
A1  - Munsif, Maitri
A1  - Stevenson, Brittany R
A1  - Elliott, Katie
A1  - Lucas, Michaela
A1  - Baird, Ashleigh J
A1  - Athan, Eugene
