T1  - National Burden Estimates of healthy life lost in India, 2017: an analysis using direct mortality data and indirect disability data.
T3  - 31708131[Comment in: Lancet Glob Health. 2019 Dec;7(12):e1593-e1594. doi: 10.1016/S2214-109X(19)30471-1.]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/S2214-109X(19)30451-6
A1  - Menon, Geetha R
A1  - Singh, Lucky
A1  - Sharma, Palak
A1  - Yadav, Priyanka
