T1  - Randomized Trial of Standard Adjuvant Chemotherapy Regimens Versus Capecitabine in Older Women With Early Breast Cancer: 10-Year Update of the CALGB 49907 Trial.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1200/JCO.19.00647
A1  - Muss, Hyman B
A1  - Polley, Mei-Yin C
A1  - Berry, Donald A
A1  - Liu, Heshan
A1  - Cirrincione, Constance T
A1  - Theodoulou, Maria
A1  - Mauer, Ann M
A1  - Kornblith, Alice B
A1  - Partridge, Ann H
A1  - Dressler, Lynn G
A1  - Cohen, Harvey J
A1  - Kartcheske, Patricia A
A1  - Perez, Edith A
