T1  - Impact of Disagreement Between Two Risk Group Models on Prognosis in Patients With Metastatic Renal-Cell Carcinoma.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.clgc.2019.01.006
A1  - Okita, Kazutaka
A1  - Hatakeyama, Shingo
