T1  - Increased liver stiffness is associated with mortality in HIV/HCV coinfected subjects: The French nationwide ANRS CO13 HEPAVIH cohort study.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0211286
A1  - Shili-Masmoudi, Sarah
A1  - Sogni, Philippe
