T1  - Urinary biomarkers predict advanced acute kidney injury after cardiovascular surgery.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1186/s13054-018-2035-8
A1  - Wang, Jian-Jhong
A1  - Chi, Nai-Hsin
