T1  - Poor Prognostic Factors in Patients with Malignant Pleural Mesothelioma Classified as Pathological Stage IB According to the Eighth Edition TNM Classification.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1245/s10434-018-6458-x
A1  - Takuwa, Teruhisa
A1  - Hashimoto, Masaki
A1  - Kuroda, Ayumi
