T1  - Evaluation of data sources and approaches for estimation of influenza-associated mortality in India.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1111/irv.12493
A1  - Narayan, Venkatesh Vinayak
A1  - Iuliano, Angela Danielle
A1  - Roguski, Katherine
A1  - Haldar, Partha
A1  - Saha, Siddhartha
