T1  - Mortality due to noncommunicable diseases in Brazil, 1990 to 2015, according to estimates from the Global Burden of Disease study.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1590/1516-3180.2016.0330050117
A1  - Malta, Deborah Carvalho
A1  - Franca, Elisabeth
A1  - Abreu, Daisy Maria Xavier
