T1  - Limited Added Value of Circulating Inflammatory Biomarkers in Chronic Heart Failure.
T3  - 28359414[Comment in: JACC Heart Fail. 2017 Apr;5(4):265-267. doi: 10.1016/j.jchf.2017.02.019.]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.jchf.2017.01.008
A1  - Nymo, Stale H
