T1  - Proenkephalin, Renal Dysfunction, and Prognosis in Patients With Acute Heart Failure: A GREAT Network Study.
T3  - 28057252[Comment in: J Am Coll Cardiol. 2017 Jan 3;69(1):70-72. doi: 10.1016/j.jacc.2016.11.016.]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.jacc.2016.10.038
A1  - Ng, Leong L
