T1  - Mortality trends and differentials in South Africa from 1997 to 2012: second National Burden of Disease Study.
T3  - 27539796[Comment in: Lancet Glob Health. 2016 Sep;4(9):e588-9. doi: 10.1016/S2214-109X(16)30178-4.], 28193396[Erratum in: Lancet Glob Health. 2017 Mar;5(3):e275. doi: 10.1016/S2214-109X(17)30055-4.]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/S2214-109X(16)30113-9
A1  - Pillay-van Wyk, Victoria
A1  - Msemburi, William
A1  - Laubscher, Ria
A1  - Dorrington, Rob E
A1  - Groenewald, Pam
A1  - Glass, Tracy
A1  - Nojilana, Beatrice
A1  - Joubert, Jane D
A1  - Matzopoulos, Richard
