T1  - Invasively Measured Aortic Systolic Blood Pressure and Office Systolic Blood Pressure in Cardiovascular Risk Assessment: A Prospective Cohort Study.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1161/HYPERTENSIONAHA.116.07495
A1  - Laugesen, Esben
A1  - Knudsen, Soren T
A1  - Hansen, Klavs W
A1  - Rossen, Niklas B
A1  - Jensen, Lisette Okkels
A1  - Hansen, Michael G
A1  - Munkholm, Henrik
A1  - Thomsen, Kristian K
A1  - Sondergaard, Hanne
A1  - Bottcher, Morten
A1  - Raungaard, Bent
