T1  - Multilocular Cystic Renal Cell Carcinoma: Pathological T Staging Makes No Difference to Favorable Outcomes and Should be Reclassified.
T3  - 27477546[Comment in: J Urol. 2016 Nov;196(5):1355. doi: 10.1016/j.juro.2016.05.128.], 28416104[Comment in: Urol Oncol. 2017 Jun;35(6):450-451. doi: 10.1016/j.urolonc.2017.03.019.]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.juro.2016.05.118
A1  - Bhatt, Jaimin R
A1  - Jewett, Michael A S
A1  - Richard, Patrick O
A1  - Kawaguchi, Sarah
