T1  - Morning and Evening Home Blood Pressure and Risks of Incident Stroke and Coronary Artery Disease in the Japanese General Practice Population: The Japan Morning Surge-Home Blood Pressure Study.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1161/HYPERTENSIONAHA.116.07201
A1  - Hoshide, Satoshi
