T1  - Amyloid-beta (1-40) and the risk of death from cardiovascular causes in patients with coronary heart disease.
T3  - 25744008[Comment in: J Am Coll Cardiol. 2015 Mar 10;65(9):917-9. doi: 10.1016/j.jacc.2015.01.013.]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.jacc.2014.12.035
A1  - Stamatelopoulos, Kimon
A1  - Sibbing, Dirk
A1  - Rallidis, Loukianos S
