T1  - ST2 may not be a useful predictor for incident cardiovascular events, heart failure and mortality.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1136/heartjnl-2014-305968
A1  - Hughes, Maria F
A1  - Appelbaum, Sebastian
A1  - Havulinna, Aki S
