T1  - Proenkephalin and prognosis after acute myocardial infarction.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.jacc.2013.09.037
A1  - Ng, Leong L
A1  - Sandhu, Jatinderpal K
A1  - Narayan, Hafid
