T1  - Development and validation of a predicting model of all-cause mortality in patients with type 2 diabetes.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.2337/dc12-1906
A1  - De Cosmo, Salvatore
A1  - Copetti, Massimiliano
A1  - Lamacchia, Olga
A1  - Fontana, Andrea
