T1  - Unstaged cancer in a population-based registry: prevalence, predictors and patient prognosis.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.canep.2013.03.005
A1  - Gurney, Jason
A1  - Sarfati, Diana
A1  - Stanley, James
A1  - Dennett, Elizabeth
