T1  - Postmortem analyses of gaseous and volatile substances in pericardial fluid and bone marrow aspirate.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1093/jat/bkt004
A1  - Tominaga, Mariko
A1  - Ishikawa, Takaki
A1  - Michiue, Tomomi
