T1  - Metabolic syndrome and mortality in the elderly: a time-dependent association.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.diabres.2012.11.005
A1  - Ghaem Maralani, Haleh
A1  - Tai, Bee Choo
A1  - Wong, Tien Y
