T1  - Declining autopsy rates and suicide misclassification: a cross-national analysis of 35 countries.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1001/archgenpsychiatry.2011.66
A1  - Kapusta, Nestor D
A1  - Tran, Ulrich S
A1  - Rockett, Ian R H
A1  - De Leo, Diego
