T1  - Mortality in adult congenital heart disease: are national registries reliable for cause of death?.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.ijcard.2010.07.018
A1  - Zomer, A Carla
A1  - Uiterwaal, Cuno S P M
A1  - van der Velde, Enno T
