T1  - Effects of the end point adjudication process on the results of the Perindopril Protection Against Recurrent Stroke Study (PROGRESS).
T3  - 19762697[Comment in: Stroke. 2009 Nov;40(11):e638; author reply e639-40. doi: 10.1161/STROKEAHA.109.562181.]
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1161/STROKEAHA.108.539601
A1  - Ninomiya, Toshiharu
