T1  - Incidence and survival of childhood bone cancer in northern England and the West Midlands, 1981-2002.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1038/sj.bjc.6604837
A1  - Eyre, R
A1  - Feltbower, R G
A1  - Mubwandarikwa, E
