T1  - The IASLC Lung Cancer Staging Project: proposals for the revision of the TNM stage groupings in the forthcoming (seventh) edition of the TNM Classification of malignant tumours.
T3  - [Erratum in: J Thorac Oncol. 2007 Oct;2(10):985], 17762332[Comment in: J Thorac Oncol. 2007 Aug;2(8):682-3. doi: 10.1097/JTO.0b013e318145af89.], 20421773[Comment in: J Thorac Oncol. 2010 May;5(5):754. doi: 10.1097/JTO.0b013e3181d6bc50.], 21847068[Comment in: J Thorac Oncol. 2011 Aug;6(8):1451. doi: 10.1097/JTO.0b013e318224643b.]
