T1  - Localisation of the gene causing diaphyseal dysplasia Camurati-Engelmann to chromosome 19q13.
DO  - https://dx.doi.org/10.1136/jmg.37.4.245
A1  - Janssens, K
A1  - Gershoni-Baruch, R
A1  - Van Hul, E
A1  - Brik, R
