N2  - The basic data used are statistics of causes of death by sex and age group, with corrections taking into account unspecified causes of death. In a first part, we measure, with a model, the statistical linkage between mortality by cause and alcohol consumption, estimated from mortality of alcoholism. In a second part, the linkage has been calculated without influence of tobacco consumption.
